WEBVTT

01:33.061 --> 01:35.494
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:35.594 --> 01:37.867
(Adapted from the novel "A City, Waiting for You" by Jiuyuexi)

01:37.953 --> 01:40.813
(Episode 7)

02:01.801 --> 02:02.921
I passed by after work.

02:03.361 --> 02:05.960
So, I casually asked if you were around.

02:06.361 --> 02:08.120
I didn't think they'd ask you to come out.

02:11.320 --> 02:12.040
Why are you here?

02:14.121 --> 02:16.561
I already said what I wanted to in WeChat.

02:17.360 --> 02:18.001
Please leave.

02:45.600 --> 02:46.681
Let me treat you to a meal.

02:48.920 --> 02:49.841
I already said no.

02:50.320 --> 02:51.320
Then you can treat me.

02:53.920 --> 02:54.760
What?

02:56.200 --> 02:57.281
Just tea is fine.

03:00.841 --> 03:02.161
Why would I treat you to tea?

03:05.121 --> 03:08.520
Yesterday, I lent you my space to carry out your rescue mission.

03:09.200 --> 03:10.520
As the person in charge,

03:11.281 --> 03:12.561
shouldn't you show some gratitude?

03:13.161 --> 03:14.681
I waited the whole day yesterday,

03:15.281 --> 03:17.200
but you didn't even call to say thanks.

03:19.320 --> 03:20.721
Was I supposed to have hired a band

03:21.200 --> 03:22.441
while I presented you with a pennant?

03:23.681 --> 03:24.920
That's fine by me.

03:25.401 --> 03:27.841
Otherwise, I became a model citizen for nothing.

03:28.320 --> 03:29.480
How could you do that?

03:34.681 --> 03:35.281
Xu Qin.

03:36.681 --> 03:37.800
Do other people know about

03:38.480 --> 03:39.561
this side of you?

03:42.080 --> 03:43.001
Which side?

03:48.561 --> 03:49.401
Fine.

03:50.161 --> 03:51.040
As you wish, milady.

03:59.360 --> 04:01.360
-Scram. -Let's get out of here.

04:02.360 --> 04:02.920
Jiang Yi.

04:06.480 --> 04:07.040
Captain.

04:08.241 --> 04:09.080
We saw everything.

04:10.920 --> 04:12.681
I dare you to give my number away again.

04:15.600 --> 04:16.760
They can add you on WeChat,

04:17.241 --> 04:18.481
but you don't have to approve it.

04:21.361 --> 04:22.337
I was wrong!

04:22.361 --> 04:23.256
I was wrong, Captain!

04:23.280 --> 04:24.296
-Get back here. -I was wrong, Captain.

04:24.320 --> 04:25.080
Come back here!

04:25.308 --> 04:27.148
(Yanbei Fire and Rescue Detachment)

05:05.801 --> 05:08.001
Xiao Yao, call me when you're up.

05:08.080 --> 05:08.840
It's urgent.

05:11.041 --> 05:11.760
Coming.

05:15.241 --> 05:16.001
Xu Qin.

05:16.280 --> 05:17.441
You got here fast, Xiao Yao.

05:24.640 --> 05:26.296
I don't have extra slippers.

05:26.320 --> 05:27.001
Just come in.

05:27.481 --> 05:28.121
It's fine.

05:28.200 --> 05:29.001
I'm fine without them.

05:31.400 --> 05:33.001
Your house is so nice.

05:34.041 --> 05:35.241
I like the color scheme.

05:35.960 --> 05:37.361
My dad bought it for me.

05:37.520 --> 05:40.041
He said it's only 10 minutes away from my work.

05:41.320 --> 05:42.121
Sit.

05:45.441 --> 05:47.520
Though your house is

05:49.280 --> 05:50.080
so clean.

05:51.441 --> 05:53.960
Did you mean it's lacking personality?

05:54.520 --> 05:55.136
Not so.

05:55.160 --> 05:56.537
You have no idea how much stuff is strewn around my house

05:56.561 --> 05:57.977
till there's hardly any place to sit.

05:58.001 --> 06:00.361
Every time the cleaner lady comes, she regrets it.

06:01.080 --> 06:01.760
Check these out.

06:03.121 --> 06:04.256
That was fast.

06:04.280 --> 06:05.441
Where did you get these?

06:05.601 --> 06:06.577
I stockpile.

06:06.601 --> 06:07.936
It's important to have extra

06:07.960 --> 06:09.320
of cosmetics and skincare.

06:09.640 --> 06:11.217
You don't want to be out of them when you need them.

06:11.241 --> 06:12.361
See? Isn't it nice?

06:13.280 --> 06:14.400
How much do I have to pay you?

06:15.520 --> 06:16.640
Stop that or I'm leaving.

06:16.921 --> 06:18.921
-I can't... -Hurry up. Where should we do it?

06:19.080 --> 06:19.881
Take the stuff.

06:22.601 --> 06:23.720
Keep still. Don't blink.

06:35.481 --> 06:36.080
Close your eyes.

06:42.200 --> 06:44.441
Look how beautiful you are with makeup.

06:45.481 --> 06:46.561
Let me add a bit more.

06:47.640 --> 06:49.017
I must say you're a rare breed.

06:49.041 --> 06:50.017
There's actually people

06:50.041 --> 06:51.520
who don't know makeup in this era.

06:51.960 --> 06:53.097
I'm a surgeon.

06:53.121 --> 06:54.361
Makeup messes with hygiene.

06:54.561 --> 06:56.160
You could use makeup when you're off work.

06:57.960 --> 06:59.097
Where are you going today

06:59.121 --> 07:00.160
that you're dressing up?

07:01.640 --> 07:02.320
I...

07:03.881 --> 07:04.801
I'm going on a blind date.

07:05.080 --> 07:06.001
Blind date?

07:06.640 --> 07:08.001
That's great.

07:08.160 --> 07:08.960
You know what?

07:09.481 --> 07:10.577
This can't be explained.

07:10.601 --> 07:13.481
My friends who went through thick and thin to be together

07:13.921 --> 07:15.537
somehow rarely have good endings.

07:15.561 --> 07:16.457
On the contrary,

07:16.481 --> 07:17.777
those that follow their parents arrangement

07:17.801 --> 07:19.361
are now in happy and stable relationships.

07:20.520 --> 07:21.320
Really?

07:21.760 --> 07:22.376
Yeah.

07:22.400 --> 07:23.960
Do your parents urge you?

07:24.320 --> 07:25.241
Me?

07:25.320 --> 07:26.320
About marriage?

07:26.840 --> 07:28.080
They let me do what I want.

07:28.320 --> 07:29.337
I've already made it clear to them.

07:29.361 --> 07:32.241
For me, I only want to be in a happy, dating relationship.

07:32.441 --> 07:33.601
Just dating?

07:34.561 --> 07:37.241
Don't you want to be with the person you love forever?

07:39.400 --> 07:40.441
Forever?

07:40.840 --> 07:43.041
I don't even know if I can love one person forever.

07:43.160 --> 07:44.616
Let alone be with him forever.

07:44.640 --> 07:47.001
I just want to enjoy life.

07:47.200 --> 07:48.616
If I'm happy, I'll date.

07:48.640 --> 07:50.280
If I'm not, then bye-bye.

07:51.681 --> 07:52.720
Let's contour the double chin.

08:01.760 --> 08:02.840
It's full of nicks.

08:03.241 --> 08:03.857
Hush.

08:03.881 --> 08:05.496
Can you really do it, Chi?

08:05.520 --> 08:06.936
I mean, it's not even.

08:06.960 --> 08:07.801
You do it then.

08:08.241 --> 08:08.897
Looks good.

08:08.921 --> 08:09.960
See? It looks good.

08:10.320 --> 08:11.801
-Nicks everywhere. -Stay still.

08:12.441 --> 08:13.176
Looks handsome.

08:13.200 --> 08:14.881
Listen to Jun Ping. He knows his stuff.

08:15.520 --> 08:16.320
Let me wash my hands.

08:16.601 --> 08:18.296
Captain, your hair is long, too.

08:18.320 --> 08:19.160
You should get a trim.

08:20.160 --> 08:21.720
Captain, do you want a haircut?

08:22.080 --> 08:23.041
I'm almost done with Da Peng.

08:23.160 --> 08:24.041
You can be next.

08:24.280 --> 08:24.960
Halt.

08:25.241 --> 08:26.777
Captain's hair is cut by the instructor.

08:26.801 --> 08:27.857
No need for you.

08:27.881 --> 08:28.601
Give me a break.

08:28.881 --> 08:29.481
Captain.

08:29.681 --> 08:32.001
Captain, don't listen to Chi.

08:32.160 --> 08:34.057
Truth is, this is the last time I'm letting him cut my hair.

08:34.081 --> 08:34.817
What the heck?

08:34.841 --> 08:36.136
I have the nickname Tony Yang

08:36.160 --> 08:37.321
because of my skills.

08:40.721 --> 08:41.961
Look at all the nicks.

08:42.961 --> 08:43.800
I'm sorry, brother.

08:44.520 --> 08:45.280
What was that?

08:46.081 --> 08:46.817
You have no faith in me?

08:46.841 --> 08:48.121
Chi, I don't think you know how to cut.

08:48.280 --> 08:50.560
Fine, I quit. No one appreciates my skills.

08:52.241 --> 08:53.001
You want a haircut?

08:54.241 --> 08:54.961
I'll do it.

09:05.160 --> 09:05.881
Sir.

09:06.121 --> 09:06.920
Sir.

09:10.081 --> 09:11.040
It's a waste

09:11.560 --> 09:13.177
that you're not using your skills on grass cutting.

09:13.201 --> 09:14.817
I'm not kidding, my nickname is Tony Yang.

09:14.841 --> 09:15.481
Sure.

09:17.520 --> 09:18.440
No one believes me.

09:33.321 --> 09:34.001
The usual?

11:14.961 --> 11:15.721
Waited long?

11:16.121 --> 11:17.680
No, I just got here, too.

11:18.640 --> 11:19.321
Where are we going?

11:21.680 --> 11:22.481
That way.

11:49.321 --> 11:50.440
Let's eat here.

11:54.241 --> 11:55.001
Okay?

12:01.343 --> 12:05.443
(This city has memories because of you)

12:13.280 --> 12:13.800
Well?

12:14.121 --> 12:14.841
Do you want to try?

12:17.680 --> 12:18.560
I'm not hungry.

12:20.680 --> 12:22.560
Since you're buying, I'm going to order what I want.

12:26.481 --> 12:28.520
Excuse me, one fried chicken,

12:28.721 --> 12:29.800
one sweet potato fries,

12:30.040 --> 12:32.121
fried calamari, and yam balls.

12:33.121 --> 12:34.121
Plus two glasses of coke.

12:34.280 --> 12:35.040
Sure.

12:35.760 --> 12:37.057
Salt and pepper or chili powder?

12:37.081 --> 12:37.920
Both, please.

12:38.081 --> 12:39.001
He doesn't eat spicy food.

12:39.640 --> 12:40.881
Okay. It will be right up.

13:01.440 --> 13:02.361
Here you go.

13:03.400 --> 13:04.160
Thanks.

13:04.721 --> 13:05.361
You're welcome.

13:09.481 --> 13:10.760
Please enjoy.

13:20.680 --> 13:21.400
It's weird.

13:22.680 --> 13:23.361
What is?

13:25.481 --> 13:27.001
It tastes just like how it used to.

13:27.361 --> 13:29.280
Many restaurants, once business picks up,

13:29.520 --> 13:31.081
the taste and quality tend to dip.

13:31.680 --> 13:32.680
But not this place.

13:33.640 --> 13:35.081
It's still as good as I remember.

13:36.841 --> 13:37.760
I think the taste has changed.

13:39.721 --> 13:40.680
It's almost ten years.

13:42.400 --> 13:43.520
The taste couldn't have stayed the same.

13:45.001 --> 13:45.961
I think it hasn't.

13:47.400 --> 13:48.201
Perhaps,

13:49.800 --> 13:51.201
it is your taste that has changed.

13:56.280 --> 13:56.881
I guess you're right.

13:57.400 --> 13:58.520
My taste is different now.

14:00.201 --> 14:03.001
I don't like the foods I used to like.

14:20.040 --> 14:21.697
Boss, two portions of yam balls.

14:21.721 --> 14:22.256
Okay.

14:22.280 --> 14:23.081
Please take a seat inside.

14:23.121 --> 14:24.321
The school uniform is still the same.

14:25.121 --> 14:26.440
It still looks as nice as before.

14:29.280 --> 14:30.400
Don't talk while you eat.

15:16.601 --> 15:17.800
Can you not dilly-dally?

15:46.841 --> 15:47.520
Xu Qin.

15:50.321 --> 15:53.201
You're too old to be acting cute, you hear?

15:54.721 --> 15:55.520
What?

16:07.081 --> 16:07.680
You eat.

16:08.040 --> 16:08.841
I'll wait for you outside.

16:17.961 --> 16:18.961
A bunch of tricks.

16:33.520 --> 16:33.937
Hello?

16:33.961 --> 16:34.881
(Hello, Yan?)

16:35.201 --> 16:36.201
(Come and save me.)

16:36.800 --> 16:37.241
What is it?

16:37.361 --> 16:38.241
What's happened?

16:39.040 --> 16:40.400
I'm at the police station.

16:40.560 --> 16:41.760
Please come, quick.

16:42.040 --> 16:42.961
Don't tell my parents.

16:44.001 --> 16:44.881
Which police station?

16:45.520 --> 16:46.800
Fuming Police Station.

16:47.121 --> 16:48.121
(Okay. Wait there.)

16:48.201 --> 16:49.081
(I'm coming now.)

16:53.321 --> 16:54.400
What's the matter? Something happened?

16:54.800 --> 16:56.160
Yes. I have to go.

16:56.560 --> 16:58.481
It's peak hour. I can give you a ride.

17:04.560 --> 17:05.361
Hi, Lin.

17:05.801 --> 17:06.400
(I'm here.)

17:06.801 --> 17:08.521
Navigate to Fuming Police Station.

17:09.041 --> 17:09.761
(Sure.)

17:09.920 --> 17:12.361
(Here's the way to Fuming Police Station.)

17:15.200 --> 17:16.200
Don't worry too much.

17:16.680 --> 17:17.896
Zhai Miao is a student.

17:17.920 --> 17:19.081
She won't be in too much trouble.

17:19.361 --> 17:20.361
You don't know her.

17:21.400 --> 17:22.640
It's either she knocked a car,

17:23.321 --> 17:24.920
or she got into a fight with someone.

17:25.720 --> 17:27.321
She speaks without using her brain.

17:27.960 --> 17:28.801
That might get her beaten up.

17:35.960 --> 17:36.761
I don't need your help.

17:37.400 --> 17:38.841
So no need to make any calls.

17:46.480 --> 17:48.881
Where is Zhai Miao studying now?

17:49.881 --> 17:50.521
Yancheng University.

17:51.281 --> 17:52.281
Her results must be good.

17:52.920 --> 17:54.881
I remember she was quite naughty when younger.

17:55.160 --> 17:56.160
She didn't like studying.

17:58.041 --> 17:58.801
But she's smart.

17:59.400 --> 18:00.361
Why the sigh?

18:01.200 --> 18:02.081
It's easier

18:02.281 --> 18:04.200
for smart people to find shortcuts to success.

18:05.121 --> 18:06.160
The more they do it,

18:06.561 --> 18:09.601
the less respect they have for customary rules.

18:10.601 --> 18:11.480
When everything seems to work out,

18:12.121 --> 18:13.440
they become careless and go overboard.

18:16.200 --> 18:17.081
I think

18:17.801 --> 18:19.440
you'd make a good parent.

18:34.801 --> 18:35.200
Thank you.

18:35.561 --> 18:36.337
You can go.

18:36.361 --> 18:37.160
I'll go in with you.

18:37.521 --> 18:38.416
A bystander is neutral.

18:38.440 --> 18:39.960
Perhaps it'd be easier for me to talk to her.

19:01.081 --> 19:01.841
What happened?

19:02.240 --> 19:02.801
Did you fight again?

19:03.561 --> 19:04.720
No, I didn't.

19:04.920 --> 19:05.281
I...

19:07.960 --> 19:09.081
Why is she here?

19:09.920 --> 19:11.761
Zhai Miao, be serious.

19:12.160 --> 19:12.960
This is no time for tantrums.

19:13.561 --> 19:14.680
Are you her cousin?

19:15.680 --> 19:16.121
Yes.

19:16.960 --> 19:17.841
What did she do?

19:19.321 --> 19:20.160
Selling fake goods.

19:20.640 --> 19:21.960
The person who made the dispute just left.

19:29.680 --> 19:30.561
What is this about?

19:32.521 --> 19:34.281
My part-time job was a scam.

19:34.521 --> 19:35.801
I didn't know.

19:36.400 --> 19:37.361
Didn't know?

19:38.121 --> 19:39.281
Aren't you a college student?

19:39.680 --> 19:40.881
You sold fake goods.

19:41.000 --> 19:42.881
You're educated enough to know this is illegal.

19:44.200 --> 19:44.896
Officer.

19:44.920 --> 19:46.017
I really didn't know.

19:46.041 --> 19:47.680
I didn't know they were fake goods.

19:47.761 --> 19:49.136
Besides, there were other part-timers.

19:49.160 --> 19:50.841
Why did you only apprehend me?

19:51.121 --> 19:52.257
I'm just a poor student.

19:52.281 --> 19:53.720
I can't afford luxury goods.

19:54.121 --> 19:56.160
How should I know whether they're genuine or not?

19:57.200 --> 19:58.257
Yan, you have to help me.

19:58.281 --> 19:59.297
Help me explain to them.

19:59.321 --> 20:00.240
Explain what?

20:01.720 --> 20:02.960
I thought you got beaten up,

20:03.200 --> 20:04.361
but you're asking for it.

20:06.400 --> 20:07.561
Listen up, Zhai Miao.

20:08.121 --> 20:09.081
You created this mess.

20:09.640 --> 20:10.521
You figure it out.

20:11.121 --> 20:12.440
How am I supposed to do that?

20:15.240 --> 20:16.041
Then speak.

20:16.480 --> 20:17.920
Who gave you these goods?

20:20.920 --> 20:21.761
I asked her.

20:22.041 --> 20:24.561
She refused to name her supplier.

20:33.601 --> 20:34.801
I'm asking you one last time.

20:35.920 --> 20:37.960
Who gave you these goods?

20:39.680 --> 20:40.640
I don't know!

20:42.920 --> 20:44.281
Still refusing to own up, huh?

20:47.041 --> 20:47.920
Contact her school.

20:49.841 --> 20:50.281
Yan...

20:50.680 --> 20:52.017
Okay. Which university does she go to?

20:52.041 --> 20:52.720
Song Yan.

20:53.960 --> 20:55.200
Let me talk to her in private.

20:55.761 --> 20:56.521
What's there to talk about?

20:57.281 --> 20:58.281
Look at her.

20:58.920 --> 20:59.936
She is unrepentant.

20:59.960 --> 21:01.121
She had to be put in her place.

21:02.321 --> 21:03.577
What if you told the school

21:03.601 --> 21:04.881
and they expelled her?

21:06.081 --> 21:08.281
How will you explain to your aunt and uncle?

21:15.640 --> 21:17.000
Sorry, Officer.

21:17.281 --> 21:19.281
Could I have some time to talk to her in private?

21:21.680 --> 21:22.121
Fine.

21:22.361 --> 21:22.841
Make it quick.

21:23.121 --> 21:23.720
Thank you.

21:24.960 --> 21:25.480
Zhai Miao.

21:38.881 --> 21:39.801
Just speak your mind.

21:41.521 --> 21:43.321
You heard what Song Yan said just now.

21:43.440 --> 21:45.521
You know very well how straight-laced he is.

21:46.000 --> 21:47.240
Reason over personal ties.

21:49.041 --> 21:50.640
If you still won't name your supplier,

21:50.960 --> 21:52.121
he'd really inform your school.

21:53.000 --> 21:53.960
This is my problem.

21:54.281 --> 21:55.361
I didn't ask for your help.

21:55.601 --> 21:57.720
Zhai Miao, don't try to be clever.

21:58.841 --> 22:00.801
-What... -You think you're great, huh?

22:01.240 --> 22:03.000
Your little tricks are laughable at best.

22:04.680 --> 22:06.160
What you did today is a minor offense.

22:06.400 --> 22:08.640
Song Yan could probably get you out after paying a fine.

22:09.521 --> 22:11.537
But what if someone got scarred or poisoned

22:11.561 --> 22:12.720
and they want you in jail?

22:12.960 --> 22:13.761
That won't happen.

22:14.000 --> 22:15.416
I tried all the products myself.

22:15.440 --> 22:17.200
They are safe to use.

22:19.041 --> 22:19.920
Which means,

22:20.240 --> 22:21.521
you're not going to name the supplier.

22:21.920 --> 22:23.601
Are you thinking to continue once this blows over?

22:24.000 --> 22:25.400
-I'm not... -Stop lying.

22:26.240 --> 22:28.801
Honestly, I couldn't care less about you.

22:29.240 --> 22:30.416
If it hadn't been for Song Yan today,

22:30.440 --> 22:32.121
I wouldn't even be here talking to you.

22:32.801 --> 22:34.281
You're an adult.

22:34.601 --> 22:36.281
You are responsible for your own actions.

22:37.521 --> 22:38.960
Stop making trouble for Song Yan.

22:39.640 --> 22:40.561
Xu Qin.

22:40.881 --> 22:42.240
Stop acting all self-righteous.

22:42.601 --> 22:43.680
What a hypocrite.

22:44.561 --> 22:46.041
I know what I am.

22:47.881 --> 22:48.680
But you,

22:49.361 --> 22:50.640
you have no idea where you stand.

22:52.601 --> 22:53.841
Can't believe Song Yan called you smart.

22:54.400 --> 22:55.881
You look like a dumb fool to me.

22:57.440 --> 22:58.656
You go to a good school with good grades.

22:58.680 --> 23:00.081
Your future after graduating is bright.

23:00.281 --> 23:01.720
There's plenty of money waiting for you.

23:02.561 --> 23:03.160
But then,

23:03.521 --> 23:05.200
you don't study when you're supposed to.

23:05.440 --> 23:07.121
You got tempted to make a quick buck.

23:07.321 --> 23:08.400
What are you if not dumb?

23:14.640 --> 23:16.920
It's not too late if you name the supplier now.

23:17.640 --> 23:20.561
I don't think Song Yan actually wants you to

23:21.640 --> 23:23.160
But if you won't repent,

23:24.000 --> 23:25.361
he will do what he must.

23:29.041 --> 23:29.801
Go and apologize.

23:38.720 --> 23:39.920
This is my supplier.

23:45.601 --> 23:46.121
Wang.

23:47.041 --> 23:48.000
Look into this person.

23:48.160 --> 23:48.640
Okay.

23:51.720 --> 23:52.361
Go on.

23:52.561 --> 23:53.680
How did you meet her?

23:54.361 --> 23:57.000
We met in a group for part-timers.

23:57.200 --> 23:58.761
She was very nice right from the get-go,

23:58.841 --> 24:00.680
introducing me to a lot of part-time work.

24:00.920 --> 24:02.160
She's quite reliable.

24:02.321 --> 24:03.761
She gave me all the fees she promised.

24:04.400 --> 24:05.761
A month ago,

24:06.041 --> 24:07.976
she said her friend had some lipsticks

24:08.000 --> 24:09.640
that were seized by customs.

24:09.801 --> 24:11.640
She asked if I knew of any ways to sell them.

24:11.801 --> 24:15.041
She even showed me the paperwork issued by the customs.

24:15.480 --> 24:17.601
Oh, she also sent me dozens of samples.

24:18.081 --> 24:19.337
I was worried they might be fake, too

24:19.361 --> 24:20.640
so I checked at the stores.

24:20.881 --> 24:22.400
I only started selling them near the campus

24:23.000 --> 24:25.121
after verifying the authenticity.

24:25.561 --> 24:27.480
There were some foreign students

24:27.720 --> 24:29.041
who approached me for the goods.

24:29.440 --> 24:31.081
I made 30 yuan for one lipstick.

24:31.881 --> 24:32.801
I never would've thought

24:33.081 --> 24:34.537
she sent me authentic samples,

24:34.561 --> 24:36.000
but the later goods were fake.

24:36.640 --> 24:38.761
That's how scammers scam people.

24:38.920 --> 24:40.640
You wouldn't have fallen for it if they didn't bait you.

24:41.041 --> 24:42.521
Why didn't you name the culprit just now?

24:43.841 --> 24:45.737
When I realized something was off,

24:45.761 --> 24:47.200
I called them.

24:47.480 --> 24:48.400
They said,

24:48.640 --> 24:50.200
the warehouse sent the wrong goods.

24:50.400 --> 24:52.480
If I reported it to the police,

24:53.081 --> 24:55.121
they wouldn't give me back my money.

24:57.281 --> 24:58.440
How many did you sell?

24:59.200 --> 25:00.160
Probably

25:01.000 --> 25:02.240
about 500?

25:03.000 --> 25:03.920
500?

25:04.881 --> 25:06.321
I've got to hand it to you.

25:06.680 --> 25:08.081
You make 30 plus for one lipstick.

25:08.240 --> 25:09.321
So where's the money you made?

25:10.200 --> 25:11.881
I spent it to stockpile more.

25:13.761 --> 25:14.200
What...

25:17.561 --> 25:18.081
What did you find?

25:18.281 --> 25:19.376
The WeChat account is no longer active.

25:19.400 --> 25:20.680
It won't be easy to track them down.

25:26.160 --> 25:26.960
Officer.

25:27.601 --> 25:28.841
What happens now?

25:31.680 --> 25:32.361
Firstly,

25:32.561 --> 25:34.041
your cousin sold counterfeit goods.

25:34.240 --> 25:35.881
She'll need to refund the buyers in full.

25:36.121 --> 25:38.440
And pay a fine that is three times the amount of goods sold.

25:38.841 --> 25:39.680
This is the fine ticket.

25:39.881 --> 25:41.000
You may transfer to the bank account.

25:41.160 --> 25:41.680
Okay.

25:42.121 --> 25:42.680
Secondly,

25:42.960 --> 25:44.841
we only heard the story from your cousin.

25:45.000 --> 25:47.121
We can't be sure whether or not she's telling the truth.

25:47.400 --> 25:48.480
We'll have to find her supplier

25:48.601 --> 25:50.200
and verify if she's also a victim,

25:50.640 --> 25:52.321
that she was unaware of the situation.

25:52.440 --> 25:53.521
Only then could we let her go.

25:53.801 --> 25:55.521
Otherwise, she'd be either detained

25:55.801 --> 25:57.041
or her school notified.

25:58.521 --> 25:59.097
Yan.

25:59.121 --> 26:00.200
The school must not know.

26:00.480 --> 26:01.801
If they knew,

26:01.960 --> 26:03.400
there goes my graduation cert.

26:04.160 --> 26:05.361
Now you start to worry?

26:29.841 --> 26:32.200
There's an urgent family matter requiring money.

26:35.601 --> 26:36.761
I'll pay you back soon.

26:41.960 --> 26:43.881
Okay. It's fine.

26:48.281 --> 26:50.601
I really think this project is going well.

26:51.160 --> 26:52.801
Who knows it might just work?

26:53.041 --> 26:53.680
Right?

26:54.041 --> 26:56.561
Still, it's all thanks to your support.

26:59.281 --> 27:01.000
Look who's calling.

27:02.480 --> 27:04.121
I doubt the actual brother gets this special treatment.

27:06.761 --> 27:07.321
Qin.

27:07.680 --> 27:08.537
Did you miss me?

27:08.561 --> 27:09.321
(Xiao Yi Xiao.)

27:10.480 --> 27:11.361
(Can you lend me some money?)

27:12.200 --> 27:13.281
Hang on.

27:15.281 --> 27:15.720
Tell me.

27:19.920 --> 27:20.561
Where are you?

27:26.281 --> 27:27.160
Officer.

27:27.321 --> 27:28.297
This happened suddenly

27:28.321 --> 27:29.680
so I only managed to get 100,000.

27:30.841 --> 27:31.521
I'm Song Yan.

27:31.761 --> 27:33.720
The captain of Shili Tai Fire and Rescue Station.

27:36.680 --> 27:37.561
This is my identification.

27:37.680 --> 27:38.801
You can verify it.

27:39.200 --> 27:40.601
Say, what about we do this?

27:40.841 --> 27:42.041
Let me take my cousin back first.

27:42.200 --> 27:43.200
As for the arrears,

27:43.400 --> 27:44.881
I'll pay them within three days.

27:47.281 --> 27:47.881
Captain Song.

27:48.160 --> 27:49.801
This isn't only about the money owed.

27:50.321 --> 27:51.841
Before we verify the matter regarding the supplier,

27:52.081 --> 27:52.801
as per protocol,

27:52.920 --> 27:54.680
she has to be detained for further questioning.

27:55.281 --> 27:55.801
But,

27:56.521 --> 27:58.841
we will not notify her school for now.

28:01.240 --> 28:02.480
One should answer for their own actions.

28:02.680 --> 28:03.521
Just detain me.

28:03.640 --> 28:05.936
I trust that the police officers would render justice

28:05.960 --> 28:07.081
and prove that I'm innocent.

28:07.281 --> 28:08.321
Innocent my foot.

28:08.801 --> 28:09.761
You made this mess.

28:10.041 --> 28:11.121
Innocent, you say?

28:11.480 --> 28:11.896
Yan.

28:11.920 --> 28:13.616
Please tell my mom that

28:13.640 --> 28:15.416
I'll be staying in the school dorm

28:15.440 --> 28:16.480
to prepare for my exam.

28:16.680 --> 28:17.881
Tell her not to worry.

28:18.081 --> 28:18.720
Alright.

28:19.200 --> 28:19.936
Lin.

28:19.960 --> 28:20.817
Take her away.

28:20.841 --> 28:21.400
Okay.

28:21.920 --> 28:22.680
Come with me.

28:28.160 --> 28:28.960
Captain Song.

28:30.601 --> 28:31.801
This is the cross-examination consent form.

28:32.081 --> 28:33.160
Please sign it.

28:38.881 --> 28:39.361
Hello?

28:39.561 --> 28:40.616
Come straight in.

28:40.640 --> 28:41.920
I'm in the office.

28:54.281 --> 28:55.801
Why did you bring him?

28:56.240 --> 28:57.801
I was with him. I couldn't stop him from coming.

29:01.480 --> 29:01.960
Qin.

29:02.920 --> 29:03.761
You didn't tell me.

29:05.801 --> 29:07.160
I came as soon as I heard.

29:07.761 --> 29:09.081
Turn out it was to save him?

29:10.680 --> 29:12.081
You're not the one I called.

29:12.640 --> 29:13.720
You're not needed here.

29:14.841 --> 29:15.521
You can go.

29:17.400 --> 29:18.601
Watch how you speak to her.

29:19.440 --> 29:20.801
I speak the same way to you.

29:22.680 --> 29:23.017
Yan Chen.

29:23.041 --> 29:23.841
What is your problem?

29:24.440 --> 29:25.561
Asking for a fight, are we?

29:27.400 --> 29:28.240
What is this?

29:28.801 --> 29:29.857
You're at the police station.

29:29.881 --> 29:31.000
You can settle your business outside.

29:42.081 --> 29:42.737
Song Yan.

29:42.761 --> 29:43.521
Just leave.

29:44.000 --> 29:45.680
Just take the money as an IOU, okay?

29:45.761 --> 29:47.136
You've already borrowed money from friends.

29:47.160 --> 29:49.041
You can't possibly find enough money in three days.

29:49.240 --> 29:49.976
Zhai Miao is going to...

29:50.000 --> 29:50.936
She's an adult.

29:50.960 --> 29:52.160
She should own up to her mistake.

29:52.720 --> 29:54.240
How?

29:54.521 --> 29:55.257
Song Yan.

29:55.281 --> 29:56.200
Song yan!

29:58.121 --> 29:59.960
She can say that she's at school and keep it from her family.

30:00.200 --> 30:01.817
But when she misses class because she's being detained,

30:01.841 --> 30:03.081
what will you tell the school?

30:03.200 --> 30:03.920
How will you explain?

30:14.801 --> 30:16.601
I can't believe you asked me for this small amount.

30:18.561 --> 30:19.561
I should never have asked you.

30:19.960 --> 30:20.761
Don't blame me.

30:20.960 --> 30:22.281
Your brother is too sharp.

30:22.841 --> 30:23.400
Don't worry.

30:23.801 --> 30:24.801
He won't tell your mother.

30:24.960 --> 30:25.616
I know that,

30:25.640 --> 30:27.200
but why did you use his card?

30:27.640 --> 30:29.640
What am I supposed to do when he forced it on me?

30:32.160 --> 30:34.200
Are you worried that Song Yan won't be pleased?

30:35.400 --> 30:36.400
Oh, please.

30:36.640 --> 30:37.817
You did all this to get him the money

30:37.841 --> 30:38.920
and you worry about his feelings?

30:39.521 --> 30:40.640
I don't know what else to say.

30:42.680 --> 30:43.640
No need to worry.

30:43.881 --> 30:45.081
He and the girl should be released soon.

30:45.281 --> 30:45.960
Why?

30:46.321 --> 30:48.601
Your brother has all the connections. You know that.

30:48.801 --> 30:49.640
He inquired.

30:49.960 --> 30:51.561
Coincidentally, he saw someone he knew.

30:51.761 --> 30:53.480
They were handling a case that overlapped

30:53.720 --> 30:54.801
with Song Yan and the girl's.

31:40.881 --> 31:41.801
I've paid the fine.

31:50.601 --> 31:51.920
Long time no see, Mr. Meng.

31:53.881 --> 31:55.121
Captain Zhang, sorry to trouble you.

31:55.521 --> 31:56.361
Not at all.

31:56.680 --> 31:57.561
Let me introduce you.

31:57.920 --> 32:00.281
This is Captain Wang, the head of the Economic Investigation Detachment.

32:01.761 --> 32:02.761
-Hello. -Hello.

32:05.240 --> 32:07.321
They found the supplier who supplied the fake goods.

32:07.561 --> 32:08.361
They are a repeat offender

32:08.561 --> 32:10.240
the EID have long had an eye on.

32:10.561 --> 32:10.960
Come.

32:11.321 --> 32:12.400
Let's talk over there.

32:18.640 --> 32:19.400
Thanks.

32:25.720 --> 32:26.857
Here's the thing.

32:26.881 --> 32:28.936
The supplier is named Li Hong Li.

32:28.960 --> 32:31.121
We've been investigating her for half a year.

32:31.440 --> 32:33.257
We found that there are others backing her.

32:33.281 --> 32:34.561
So we didn't rush to apprehend her.

32:34.720 --> 32:36.400
But, an arrest is imminent.

32:36.841 --> 32:39.841
Captain Song's cousin was indeed tricked.

32:40.361 --> 32:42.480
She didn't know those goods were fake.

32:42.601 --> 32:43.857
She's still a student

32:43.881 --> 32:45.321
and lacks real world experiences.

32:46.000 --> 32:46.801
How about this?

32:47.440 --> 32:48.041
Captain Zhang.

32:48.400 --> 32:50.337
Give her a good talk and she can be released.

32:50.361 --> 32:50.857
Okay.

32:50.881 --> 32:52.041
We'll wrap up the case then.

32:53.081 --> 32:54.456
I have another assignment in the afternoon.

32:54.480 --> 32:55.960
I'll take my leave.

32:56.720 --> 32:57.640
Let me see you out, Captain Wang.

32:59.160 --> 33:00.041
See you, Captain Wang.

33:06.521 --> 33:08.720
Lin. Bring the girl here.

33:11.761 --> 33:12.400
Captain Song.

33:13.321 --> 33:15.656
Since Captain Wang of EID had explained the situation,

33:15.680 --> 33:16.761
you can take your cousin and go.

33:17.000 --> 33:18.480
If there are further questions,

33:18.601 --> 33:19.640
we'll need your cooperation.

33:21.200 --> 33:22.281
Sorry for the trouble.

33:22.640 --> 33:23.440
It's all right.

33:29.960 --> 33:30.601
Yan.

33:30.720 --> 33:31.920
Are they with the Mengs?

33:34.361 --> 33:35.841
Come on, let's go home.

33:36.081 --> 33:36.680
Yan.

33:36.841 --> 33:38.136
I won't have you ask them for help.

33:38.160 --> 33:39.601
Just let the police detain me.

33:39.881 --> 33:40.857
I don't need their help.

33:40.881 --> 33:41.640
Stop your nonsense.

33:44.160 --> 33:46.761
I'll return the money in three days.

33:48.440 --> 33:48.920
Yan.

34:04.680 --> 34:05.281
We're leaving.

34:13.440 --> 34:15.120
Yan. Don't you look back.

34:23.560 --> 34:24.281
Stop looking.

34:24.600 --> 34:25.721
He's not turning around.

34:53.201 --> 34:54.920
Should we

34:55.600 --> 34:57.161
go somewhere for afternoon tea?

34:58.641 --> 35:00.161
You didn't come home this weekend

35:00.841 --> 35:02.281
because you were out frolicking with him?

35:03.281 --> 35:03.960
What?

35:04.321 --> 35:05.600
Are you going to control me like Mom?

35:06.040 --> 35:08.281
-You two. -I went out of the way to come.

35:08.520 --> 35:10.600
I also got someone to resolve the matter.

35:10.881 --> 35:11.841
Shouldn't you say thanks?

35:12.440 --> 35:13.697
Were you trying to help him

35:13.721 --> 35:14.817
or embarrass him?

35:14.841 --> 35:15.721
What now?

35:15.841 --> 35:17.161
Did I hurt his sensitive ego?

35:17.681 --> 35:18.520
Meng Yan Chen.

35:18.600 --> 35:19.560
What is it that you want?

35:19.960 --> 35:21.120
I should ask you that.

35:22.520 --> 35:24.120
It's fine if you're just playing around.

35:24.241 --> 35:25.520
But if you're serious about him,

35:26.241 --> 35:27.321
I urge you to stop.

35:28.080 --> 35:29.120
That's my personal affair.

35:29.281 --> 35:30.120
Stay out of it.

35:31.560 --> 35:32.641
So what are you going to do?

35:32.881 --> 35:34.761
Are you going to turn on your family because of him?

35:34.881 --> 35:36.056
How old are you, Meng Qin?

35:36.080 --> 35:37.576
Why do you still have such unrealistic dreams?

35:37.600 --> 35:39.000
Talk to me when you're in control of your own matters.

35:42.480 --> 35:43.080
That's enough.

35:44.080 --> 35:44.681
Qin.

35:45.040 --> 35:46.440
Don't talk to your brother like that.

35:47.480 --> 35:48.161
Same goes to you.

35:48.440 --> 35:50.080
You're all adults so be more mature.

35:55.241 --> 35:56.201
She's the immature one.

35:56.560 --> 35:57.281
He's immature.

35:57.400 --> 35:58.056
You are.

35:58.080 --> 35:59.096
-You are. -You are.

35:59.120 --> 35:59.801
Enough!

36:00.241 --> 36:01.560
Fine, I'm the immature one.

36:03.681 --> 36:04.681
You, get off.

36:05.000 --> 36:06.201
Let me talk to Qin alone.

36:07.321 --> 36:08.321
Hurry up.

36:29.440 --> 36:30.080
Yan.

36:30.920 --> 36:31.721
I'm sorry.

36:32.801 --> 36:34.440
I won't do anything illegal again.

36:34.721 --> 36:35.520
Next time,

36:35.681 --> 36:36.721
I'll use the money I earn

36:36.881 --> 36:38.440
to buy you a Porsche wedding car.

36:38.761 --> 36:39.761
I'll buy bags for your wife.

36:40.080 --> 36:42.777
I'll bring home all the good stuff from my in-laws.

36:42.801 --> 36:43.576
You can have everything.

36:43.600 --> 36:44.201
Zhai Miao.

36:44.641 --> 36:46.040
Seems like you still don't get the picture.

36:46.641 --> 36:48.161
Is that what you should be thinking about now?

36:48.681 --> 36:49.881
I'm sorry.

36:54.600 --> 36:55.641
Your lemon juice.

36:56.761 --> 36:57.801
Your milk tea.

37:01.281 --> 37:01.761
Yan.

37:03.440 --> 37:05.120
Do you still like her?

37:09.560 --> 37:11.040
Do you like her?

37:18.040 --> 37:19.201
It was fine before I met her.

37:21.201 --> 37:22.161
Yeah.

37:23.681 --> 37:25.000
It was fine before I met her.

37:26.040 --> 37:27.040
What about now that you've met her?

37:30.161 --> 37:31.681
Now that I've met her, I want to see her.

37:38.361 --> 37:39.120
Fine.

37:39.960 --> 37:41.681
I'll be more courteous the next time I see her.

37:42.080 --> 37:43.241
I won't pick on her again.

37:43.761 --> 37:44.641
Thank you very much.

37:45.841 --> 37:46.400
Yan.

37:46.600 --> 37:48.960
It's true that I don't like her.

37:49.641 --> 37:52.801
But I feel bad seeing you like this.

37:54.040 --> 37:55.321
I can tell.

37:55.440 --> 37:57.000
She actually still cares about you.

37:57.400 --> 38:00.400
Maybe you two could date again.

38:02.801 --> 38:03.881
You don't get it.

38:04.400 --> 38:05.201
Eat the food.

38:05.560 --> 38:05.960
Eat.

38:06.080 --> 38:07.241
I totally get it.

38:07.721 --> 38:09.241
It's because our two families don't get along.

38:09.480 --> 38:11.480
Her family thinks there's a mismatch in our status.

38:12.361 --> 38:13.440
How obnoxious.

38:14.960 --> 38:16.241
It's not just that.

38:16.960 --> 38:19.000
I think you're just too unyielding.

38:19.440 --> 38:20.960
What do people pursue nowadays?

38:21.801 --> 38:23.817
It's to be free and happy,

38:23.841 --> 38:24.600
to enjoy the present.

38:25.120 --> 38:26.400
Just be together if there's affection.

38:26.920 --> 38:28.016
The future is an uncertainty.

38:28.040 --> 38:29.416
No need to worry about marriage and what not.

38:29.440 --> 38:30.440
Just have a relationship.

38:30.881 --> 38:31.801
Take it one step at a time.

38:32.040 --> 38:32.777
If it works out, good.

38:32.801 --> 38:33.761
If it doesn't, so be it.

38:34.161 --> 38:37.056
It's better than you two being in perpetual limbo,

38:37.080 --> 38:38.201
so close yet so far.

38:39.040 --> 38:40.881
At least you would've experienced the joy of being together.

38:41.321 --> 38:43.600
Besides, say you two get together again

38:43.841 --> 38:45.520
and you learn her true colors.

38:45.681 --> 38:47.560
So you change your mind and move on.

38:47.641 --> 38:48.281
Isn't that great?

38:48.801 --> 38:50.137
Where do you get all your weird ideas?

38:50.161 --> 38:51.536
This isn't a weird idea.

38:51.560 --> 38:53.641
Who said being in a relationship means a happy ending?

38:53.841 --> 38:54.440
Yan.

38:54.681 --> 38:57.496
You were born with a face that can attract dozens of love interests.

38:57.520 --> 38:59.600
However, it came with a faithful, unchanging heart.

39:02.201 --> 39:03.400
Just shut up.

39:04.000 --> 39:04.960
Eat.

39:05.920 --> 39:06.960
Okay, thanks.

39:07.201 --> 39:08.000
Enjoy.

39:10.480 --> 39:11.400
Are you for real?

39:12.281 --> 39:12.841
What?

39:13.080 --> 39:13.841
Stop pretending.

39:14.161 --> 39:14.881
Should I ask Song Yan?

39:18.801 --> 39:19.960
I can't with you.

39:21.000 --> 39:22.520
Get over it, will you?

39:23.120 --> 39:25.161
There's plenty more wonders in life.

39:25.480 --> 39:26.281
What?

39:27.241 --> 39:29.040
I wish I could be like what you said.

39:31.881 --> 39:32.841
Then tell me.

39:33.201 --> 39:35.881
What is it about Song Yan that made you like him so much?

39:37.641 --> 39:38.400
I don't know.

39:39.881 --> 39:41.040
That means you really like him.

39:41.920 --> 39:42.881
Are you against it, too?

39:44.120 --> 39:46.641
Now that was uncalled for.

39:47.281 --> 39:48.337
When you two dated previously,

39:48.361 --> 39:49.721
did I ever stop you?

39:52.161 --> 39:52.920
But now,

39:53.241 --> 39:55.080
I have to dissect it for you.

39:56.400 --> 39:57.120
What if

39:57.721 --> 39:59.281
your mom adamantly opposes it?

39:59.641 --> 40:01.560
She believes that his parents and family are no good.

40:01.681 --> 40:03.400
She wants you to find someone of equal status.

40:04.040 --> 40:04.721
Then what?

40:06.361 --> 40:08.080
Some things are not normally obvious.

40:08.440 --> 40:09.560
But when it's time to talk about marriage,

40:09.801 --> 40:11.161
they become a massive hurdle.

40:11.881 --> 40:12.841
But don't blame your mom.

40:13.400 --> 40:14.761
She's wiser than you.

40:15.520 --> 40:17.040
Love comes and goes in an instance.

40:17.520 --> 40:19.761
But reality will always be there.

40:24.281 --> 40:26.080
Maybe because when I see him,

40:28.960 --> 40:30.761
that's when I feel alive.

40:34.480 --> 40:35.761
Give me a break.

40:38.080 --> 40:39.000
Anyway,

40:39.801 --> 40:42.480
does Song Yan think the same way as you?

40:44.040 --> 40:45.080
Just now at the police station,

40:46.600 --> 40:48.040
you saw how Song Yan was.

40:48.960 --> 40:50.560
Your mother and brother do not like him.

40:50.960 --> 40:52.600
I'm sure he knows.

40:53.040 --> 40:54.641
Today, he got another reality check from your brother.

40:55.761 --> 40:57.281
He is a proud man.

40:57.641 --> 40:59.520
That couldn't have felt good for him.

41:00.161 --> 41:02.496
If he chooses to let go of his pride to be with you,

41:02.520 --> 41:04.361
then I think he's even more unreliable.

41:06.681 --> 41:08.000
Heed my advice.

41:08.920 --> 41:10.120
You two are not suited for each other.

41:11.241 --> 41:12.040
I mean it.
